  "prefLabel": "Ed 1008.14 Record of Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1008.14 Record of Services. The NHVR shall maintain for each applicant and eligible individual a record of services that complies with the provisions of 34 CFR 361.47.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
